#: 5ca4e05ba39b4d0884bc95ff3acc9fdc
msgid "SERIAL6 = GPS = USART6"
msgstr "SERIAL6 = GPS = USART6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:97
#: daebc975eb614ee4a2618d537c9081c8
msgid ""
"SERIAL7 = ESC Telem = UART7 (RX tied to ESC telemetry) See "
":ref:`blheli32-esc-telemetry`"
msgstr "SERIAL7 = ESC数传 = UART7（RX连接ESC数传）参见 :ref:`blheli32-esc-telemetry`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:99
#: 81439610d893459d9e657505ae4a098f
msgid ""
"UART3 supports RX and TX DMA. UART1, UART2, UART4, and UART6 supports TX "
"DMA. UART5 and UART7 do not support DMA. Serial port protocols (Telem, GPS, "
"etc.) can be adjusted to personal preferences."
msgstr ""
"UART3支持RX和TX DMA。UART1、UART2、UART4和UART6支持TX "
"DMA。UART5和UART7不支持DMA。串口协议（数传、GPS等）可根据个人偏好调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:102
#: 8fd69b2067a14ad28c8efd93e0b155a2
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:104
#: 12d5fa04df7b4a6cb736d10a01392862
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the RX3 (UART3_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a "
"specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` is set to "
"\"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""
"遥控输入配置在RX3（UART3_RX）引脚上，支持除PPM外的所有遥控协议。特定遥控系统的详细信息请参见 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。:ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为「23」以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:106
#: 6577c18fec41420bbef1e7f25a07f268
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX3 pin but SBUS requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL连接到RX3引脚，但SBUS需要将 :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` "
"设置为「3」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:108
#: b0fd5c21bcad46ce9a0fc6172b0aed39
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX3 and :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>`"
" be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort需要连接到TX3，并将 :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` 设置为「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:110
#: c428857f213546ccb42e0ebc5bf67542
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX3 connection, in addition to RX3, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF除RX3外还需要TX3连接，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` 设置为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:112
#: ba1657f0fdf847658a39e12e1652c8d9
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX6 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2需要连接到TX6并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` 设置为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:114
#: 768a1d4e675046738475505b66eb24e8
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在ArduPilot中，任意UART均可用于遥控系统连接，兼容除PPM外的所有协议。详情参见 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:116
#: 795f7569a0e14d7d99925a59369a1f10
msgid "the V3 AIO moves this to UART2."
msgstr "V3 AIO版本将此移至UART2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:119
#: d726572b5f37444c99e9850d610c468f
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:121
#: c548709e7e784e21831c94ceb532be99
msgid ""
"The GOKU GN 745 AIO supports up to 8 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output "
"ESC1 to ESC4 on the above diagram are the first 4 outputs, there are four "
"additional pads for PWM 5-8. All 8 outputs support DShot as well as all PWM "
"types."
msgstr ""
"GOKU GN 745 AIO最多支持8路PWM输出。上图中电机输出焊盘ESC1至ESC4为前4路输出，另有4个焊盘用于PWM "
"5-8。全部8路输出均支持DShot及所有PWM类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:123
#: 541c508a32e6491bbcafef0407940fe1
msgid ""
"The Nano version has 4 esc signals, current and voltage sense inputs on an "
"external connector. The remaining outputs are on solder pads."
msgstr "Nano版本在外部连接器上有4路ESC信号、电流和电压检测输入。其余输出在焊盘上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:125
#: c4eec0189b8a4b259cbdfb515b3489d9
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads using the Nano, the first four "
"outputs M1-M4 have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using "
"these default parameters:"
msgstr "对于从BetaflightX机架迁移的Nano版本用户，前四路输出M1-M4已配置为使用现有电机接线，默认参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:127
#: 7b51fe56711442a4ba3272ca788d609c
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:128
#: 67756cb315854ca284ccaa54a3c8e988
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:131
#: 674bf565f05f48e59437e42c83fb748d
msgid "The PWM are in 5 groups: 1/2/7/8, 3/4, 5, 6"
msgstr "PWM分为5组：1/2/7/8、3/4、5、6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:133
#: 8221c3c7b29e4c7f98ab0212cfbe2f9e
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. PWM 1-4 support bidirectional DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出频率。若某组内任一通道使用DShot，则该组所有通道均须使用DShot。PWM 1-4支持双向DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:138
#: 704578ae5e4d4429b773dbedf578ce16
msgid "Neopixel Output"
msgstr "Neopixel输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:140
#: a48b2485d78d4b3d9aa93afb48a8356e
msgid ""
"The LED pin is PWM output 9 and is default setup for use with a NeoPixel 4 "
"led string for notifications."
msgstr "LED引脚为PWM输出9，默认配置用于连接4颗NeoPixel LED灯串进行状态通知。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:143
#: 9a577bf19a53447c8df88f054dbeeed0
msgid "Battery Monitor"
msgstr "电池监视器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:145
#: 2e1ddc39c75f46adb3b270984aed1579
msgid "The board has a built-in voltage and current sensors."
msgstr "飞控板内置电压和电流传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:147
#: 85fb8b541a0b4a68a29d5946ee4e8de5
msgid "The correct battery monitor parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池监视器参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:149
#: 9628bfef68f84488bc784385d124eddc
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` =  4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:150
#: fc2ed7ed92be4acdb419d0632942899c
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:151
#: da3a540934bf40e4b80cdd3c541ef9bc
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` ~ 10.9"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` ≈ 10.9"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:152
#: 5d67124530fe45c0abc289e9c0133aa1
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:153
#: 7dc89d16de1c4ef2aceeb62a74f46bf1
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` ~ 28.5 (when "
"using AIO version 1.2) (or approx 8.1 for AIO version 3)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` ≈ "
"28.5（AIO版本1.2）（AIO版本3约为8.1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:155
#: 7440ffbfd24644a7ab0fa0718e57914e
msgid ""
"These are set by default in the firmware and shouldn't need to be adjusted "
"(apart from for V3)."
msgstr "这些参数在固件中已默认设置，通常无需调整（V3版本除外）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:158
#: 98cb136e27b0436da07a34635c907797
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:160
#: b05d6a114e8b48808123a51a2402b804
msgid ""
"The GOKU GN 745 AIO does not have a builtin compass but it does have an "
"external I2C connector."
msgstr "GOKU GN 745 AIO没有内置罗盘，但提供外部I2C连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:163
#: 54bc14e8f52b4893b48bf7864465c82a
msgid "IMU"
msgstr "IMU"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:165
#: bcb6d020882e43679e3b57eb5cd83011
msgid ""
"The AIO V3 has its IMU at a different orientation to V1.2. This means "
":ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` = 5 (Yaw225) needs to be set for "
"V3."
msgstr ""
"AIO V3的IMU方向与V1.2不同，因此V3需要设置 :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` = "
"5（Yaw225）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:168
#: cb194d360ba54d54bfa84f1483c34a96
msgid "Loading ArduPilot onto the board"
msgstr "将ArduPilot加载到飞控板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:170
#: 43449caaf87747e6913e3f069787a775
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:174
#: d97784d1b076474a91a3473bcb645f12
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"xxxxxxxxxx.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用xxxxxxxxxx.apj固件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:178
#: 677b79bd5d1c4abf9ba7ca39822342e4
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-f745.rst:180
